{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Princess Ursula is a short and funny adventure game set in a folks tale setting of princes and princesses. Through the game you will play three different characters that each have their part in telling this modern re-imagining of the classic [i]Goldilocks and the Three Bears[/i] tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474790/extras/desc_image1.png?t=1741701527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wholesome story oriented adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on a tale by professional story teller Yolaine from Les Ami.e.s Imaginaires</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover <i>Princess Ursula</i>'s world by meeting a host of fully animated characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with humorous hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 1 hour of game time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with mouse or keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports French and English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiced narrations have sub-titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music by Krale</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474790/extras/desc_image2.png?t=1741701527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet people, taste food, nose around. Get married?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474790/extras/Logo_SiB_medium_cropped_transparency.png?t=1741701527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamst